# 2066 interactive calculator (one-shot: no loops in V0 — the graph IS the flow).
# Prompts via system.write, input via system.read, operator dispatch via
# compare + branch select-tree (2066 has no if-statements — selection is a
# pure value select), arithmetic in f64, division guarded against zero.
#
#   printf "12\n+\n3.5\n" | python -m runtime run examples/calculator.ai
#   -> a = op = b = result = 15.5
#
# Also try: 10 / 0 (guarded), or an unknown operator like % (rejected).

